  "scenario": [
    "html-title-error-body-retained: search, information, TOC, then one HTML content page whose ruleContent.title script throws. The selected content stage catches the title error and completes with the incoming TOC chapter name and the readable body.",
    "json-title-error-body-retained: the same four stages and the same throwing title script over a JSON source using simple ASCII property reads.",
    "html-title-saved-refresh: search, information, TOC, one HTML content page saved with needSave=true, then a real TOC refresh. Two non-volume chapters are seeded with distinct raw variable text; the first TOC name differs from the successful content title, the second keeps its name as the positive restoration control.",
    "json-title-saved-refresh: the same saved-row and refresh sequence over a JSON source using simple ASCII property reads."
  ],
